02:05.320 --> 02:08.680
MY 2 CENTS
A SERIES BY ZEROCALCARE

02:08.760 --> 02:09.880
Home. Sofa.

02:09.960 --> 02:12.320
Super Mario gameplay for Super Nintendo.

02:12.920 --> 02:14.120
I'm choked,

02:14.200 --> 02:16.120
