02:16.200 --> 02:19.200
and how nice it was when you didn't need
to have three master's degrees,

02:19.280 --> 02:22.560
watch 700 hours of videos
of puppets with dead-fish eyes

02:22.640 --> 02:26.640
and take a two-month sabbatical
from everyday life just to play a game.

02:27.240 --> 02:29.520
I know my mum's gonna be pissed off
when she hears this.

02:29.600 --> 02:31.320
For 30 years, she's been saying…

02:31.400 --> 02:32.880
You never ever left the house,

02:32.960 --> 02:37.120
and it stank of stale air
and your sweaty hormone stench!

02:37.200 --> 02:39.320
Your room smelled
like Pavarotti's nutsack.

02:40.600 --> 02:43.440
But she is, in fact,
referring to a specific time frame,

02:43.520 --> 02:44.960
that of Final Fantasy VII,

02:45.040 --> 02:47.720
which nearly made me fail
my Junior year of high school.

02:47.800 --> 02:50.040
But in terms of epicness,
emotions, and literary value,

02:50.120 --> 02:52.120
it crushed the whole Italian syllabus.

02:52.200 --> 02:55.360
Even that hunchbacked piece of shit,
what was his name? That guy…

02:56.000 --> 02:57.480
Giacomo Leopardi.

02:57.560 --> 02:59.840
Please, sweetheart,
can't you go down to the park

02:59.920 --> 03:02.280
and smoke joints outside
like Carmela's kids?

03:02.360 --> 03:04.200
I think the good weed has arrived.

03:04.280 --> 03:06.200
Mario in the square
will give it to you cheap!

03:06.280 --> 03:10.520
Shh! I have to create
the Gold Chocobo first!

03:10.600 --> 03:13.840
So, while I'm savouring the memory
of that whirlwind of emotions…

03:13.920 --> 03:15.440
VOICE NOTE

03:15.520 --> 03:17.000
…I get this message.

03:17.080 --> 03:19.560
Hey, where are you?
We were supposed to meet at 8:00.

03:19.640 --> 03:22.800
Oh, jeez! It's ten past eight.
I've completely lost track of time!

03:22.880 --> 03:26.600
These videos suck me
into a dark area of my soul,

03:26.680 --> 03:29.920
a malignant crevice
where time passes differently.

03:30.440 --> 03:31.400
When I resurface,

03:31.480 --> 03:34.400
I have to come up with some bullshit
to explain what the fuck I was doing.

03:34.480 --> 03:36.280
You mustn't get upset. There's no need.

03:36.360 --> 03:39.320
We go through such theatrics
every single day. We can handle it.

03:39.400 --> 03:43.000
Firstly, you must never lie.
Bullshit always gets found out.

03:43.080 --> 03:46.080
Write this, "I am on my way.
Sorry, but I've only just left…"

03:46.160 --> 03:49.120
But that is a lie. I haven't left,
and I still need to take a shower.

03:49.200 --> 03:51.120
It doesn't matter
if it's not true at this moment.

03:51.200 --> 03:53.360
It will be true in the very near future.

03:53.440 --> 03:56.560
We need to get ahead with the messages,
then work to reduce the lag

03:56.640 --> 03:58.720
between what it is we say
and what it is we do.

03:58.800 --> 04:00.280
-The what?
-The lag.

04:01.400 --> 04:04.280
What? Look, you gotta start
actually doing something at least.

04:04.360 --> 04:06.560
Come on. You gotta put
some effort in, Calcare.

04:06.640 --> 04:10.760
Lag is the space of time that exists
between sending and receiving a message.

04:10.840 --> 04:12.800
That grey area where bullshitters move.

04:12.880 --> 04:14.040
Oi! No man's land.

04:14.120 --> 04:16.520
Just like between your balls
and your arsehole.

04:24.880 --> 04:28.160
I'm sick and tired
Of the things I need to say

04:33.440 --> 04:37.080
You said the clothes I wear
I got in lost and found

04:37.160 --> 04:39.160
You said you're tired of how…

04:41.200 --> 04:43.960
How long does it take?
You live five minutes away!

04:44.040 --> 04:46.960
Tell her you're looking for parking.
And add a bit of detail.

04:47.040 --> 04:49.760
Like you need to park legally,
the parking attendants are on the prowl.

04:49.840 --> 04:51.040
Yeah, that's it. Tell her that.

04:51.120 --> 04:53.880
Come on, Zero! I'm leaving
if you don't get here now!

04:54.400 --> 04:57.040
Armadillo, she's getting pissed off,
and she's got a point.

04:57.120 --> 04:59.560
-What the fuck do I tell her?
-Listen, you have to be ruthless.

04:59.640 --> 05:02.480
You cannot play defensively.
Attack, attack, attack!

05:02.560 --> 05:03.600
You have to attack!

05:06.400 --> 05:07.680
Okay, tell her,

05:07.760 --> 05:10.120
"Hey, I'm here. I've parked.
Where are you? I can't see you."

05:11.360 --> 05:13.720
Don't fuck with me, Zero. You're not here.

05:13.800 --> 05:16.600
This place is 20 square metres.
It's not like you can get lost.

05:17.120 --> 05:19.840
-You didn't say the place was that small.
-It's a frigging café.

05:19.920 --> 05:23.840
Jeez, why didn't you tell me that before?
How am I supposed to work like this?

05:23.920 --> 05:26.680
It went badly. That can happen.
But we tried, right?

05:26.760 --> 05:28.920
Fortune failed us today, not our valour.

05:29.000 --> 05:30.960
Off you go.
Go and make a fool of yourself. Bye.

05:31.040 --> 05:33.600
Sorry. I made a mistake.
I went to the wrong café.

05:33.680 --> 05:36.880
Zero, how could you make a mistake?
It's your café!

05:36.960 --> 05:39.200
It's your café.

05:39.280 --> 05:41.480
I still can't wrap my head around this.

05:41.560 --> 05:43.080
"My café" just doesn't sound right.

05:43.160 --> 05:45.760
I know there are plenty of arseholes
out there thinking…

05:45.840 --> 05:47.480
You see that Zerocalcare?

05:47.560 --> 05:51.200
"I'm an underemployed. I tutor kids.
I tear along the dotted line."

05:51.280 --> 05:53.600
And then he opens a café!
They're all the same.

05:53.680 --> 05:55.640
Like that fucking pimp
at the Trillionaire club.

05:55.720 --> 05:58.400
Trillionaire club? You moron.
Go and see for yourself.

05:58.480 --> 06:01.160
It's a shithole of a café.
It's got three Salmonella stars.

06:01.240 --> 06:02.520
Look, it's been five years.

06:02.600 --> 06:05.120
I've got a bald spot so big
you could land a drone on it.

06:05.200 --> 06:06.800
But at least I put my two cents aside.

06:06.880 --> 06:09.200
Or else, why the fuck
did I make two series for Netflix?

06:09.280 --> 06:12.840
And this is precisely what everyone
who knows me thought, and in fact…

06:18.840 --> 06:21.240
This is the calm
before I get screwed, right?

06:21.320 --> 06:23.720
So, before you line your coffin
with paper bills,

06:23.800 --> 06:25.800
wanna go into business
with me at the café?

06:25.880 --> 06:26.880
Wild Boar asked me.

06:26.960 --> 06:30.160
Hey, why are you asking me?
'Cause it's going to shit, right?

06:30.240 --> 06:33.240
It's staying afloat,
but I'm on my own with a lot of expenses,

06:33.320 --> 06:35.120
and I could really do with a partner now.

06:35.200 --> 06:37.000
But you know what our friends are like.

06:37.080 --> 06:39.760
They're just a load
of screaming monkeys full of debt.

06:39.840 --> 06:41.680
You are just not like that, Zero.

06:41.760 --> 06:44.680
-You mean, I'm not messed up?
-You are, but with no debts.

06:44.760 --> 06:47.800
And I thought,
"I've known Wild Boar all my life."

06:47.880 --> 06:50.480
You can talk to him
about pretty much anything, no question.

06:50.560 --> 06:53.800
Seriously. I'm not joking.
I mean absolutely anything, right? Like…

06:53.880 --> 06:56.720
I never get to the REM sleep stage.
I wake up every half hour.

06:56.800 --> 06:58.920
If I let go of the wheel,
it pulls to the right.

06:59.000 --> 07:02.240
Hey, do you think that the guy
who kills Joker is the real Joker?

07:02.320 --> 07:05.040
He's like fractions. He trims it all
to the lowest common denominator

07:05.120 --> 07:06.680
and gets to the heart of the matter.

07:06.760 --> 07:08.920
Dude, you need to get laid!

07:11.840 --> 07:14.400
Anyway, I asked my dad
about the café thing.

07:14.480 --> 07:16.480
I belong to that generation
where, even at 40,

07:16.560 --> 07:19.120
if you have to spend more than 50 euros,
you ask your parents.

07:19.200 --> 07:22.120
Is this a good idea? You know
about this stuff. Is this a stupid move?

07:22.200 --> 07:23.440
This applies to everything,

07:23.520 --> 07:26.000
from getting a mortgage
to filling up your car.

07:29.960 --> 07:35.000
They all seem like acts of hubris to me,
like pure arrogance in front of the gods.

07:35.080 --> 07:38.280
A full tank costs 80 euros.
Have you lost your mind?

07:38.360 --> 07:42.480
It may last you a week, but who's to say
there'll be any paved roads left by then?

07:42.560 --> 07:45.320
I could turn at any moment now,
you never know.

07:45.400 --> 07:48.800
Put ten euros in.
You can always top it up tomorrow.

07:50.200 --> 07:51.680
When you talk to me…

07:51.760 --> 07:54.960
Our parents, on the other hand,
lived in the Mesozoic Era,

07:55.040 --> 07:59.240
when you were already an adult at 20,
managing responsibilities and money.

07:59.320 --> 08:00.760
They got the hang of it.

08:01.680 --> 08:04.160
Every day is Sunday

08:04.240 --> 08:05.680
A million miles from…

08:05.760 --> 08:07.480
Then they decided that our generation

08:07.560 --> 08:10.960
should only be paid in candy
until we were 80, and here we are.

08:11.040 --> 08:13.200
Anyway, when I asked him,
I was sure he'd say no

08:13.280 --> 08:16.280
because my dad never trusts anything.
He thinks everyone's out to get him.

08:16.880 --> 08:20.320
These guys are trying to screw us.
We need a lawyer to check the paperwork.

08:20.400 --> 08:23.640
A lawyer? But, dad, I really don't think
it's all that complicated.

08:23.720 --> 08:25.880
Yeah, but it's no sure thing, though.

08:25.960 --> 08:27.480
We mustn't rush things.

08:27.560 --> 08:31.000
We really should call Lino's brother,
who's both an agronomist and a surveyor.

08:31.080 --> 08:33.720
All right, fine,
I won't get the Norcia salami, okay?

08:33.800 --> 08:35.960
Can I at least get the Pringles?
They're only four euros.

08:36.040 --> 08:39.320
-No, eight euros for you.
-Do what you want. It's your money.

08:40.080 --> 08:41.680
But against all the odds, he says…

08:41.760 --> 08:45.640
I reckon you should take that share, Son.
I really like that fella.

08:47.280 --> 08:48.680
-You mean Wild Boar?
-Yeah.

08:48.760 --> 08:52.200
Even when he was a little boy,
he had all those qualities that you lack.

08:52.280 --> 08:54.000
What? Do you mean his business acumen?

08:54.080 --> 08:56.920
Well, at least I can talk to him
about pussy.

08:57.000 --> 08:59.280
