He looks like he's South American.

09:28.640 --> 09:31.840
Yeah, Carlito.

09:31.920 --> 09:33.960
He's Cuban. He's great.

09:34.040 --> 09:35.840
Even if he was an arsehole
we wouldn't know,

09:35.920 --> 09:38.880
because he never says a fucking word,
so he's great anyway.

09:39.440 --> 09:41.440
He's a snappy dresser
because he's a chauffeur.

09:41.520 --> 09:43.480
When he's not working, he comes here.

09:44.000 --> 09:46.680
When nature blesses you
with a body like a killing machine,

09:46.760 --> 09:49.000
you think
this guy's gonna be a right bully.

09:49.080 --> 09:50.920
But no, he just does his own shit,

09:51.000 --> 09:53.360
reads the sports pages
and doesn't give a damn about anyone.

09:53.440 --> 09:55.440
Yeah, him. He's kinda hot.

09:55.520 --> 09:58.840
It's a shame dicks really gross me out,
or I'd make a pass at him.

09:59.360 --> 10:01.440
But is Wild Boar happy at least, though?

10:02.080 --> 10:04.160
Let's go. I don't wanna talk
right outside the place.

10:04.240 --> 10:07.760
Listen, Zero, I really need to talk to you
about something sensitive.

10:07.840 --> 10:10.200
